# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Robinhood Pair Tracker — Environment Variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your own values.
#  Never commit .env.local to version control.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Wallet Connection ─────────────────────────────────────────
# At least ONE provider is needed for wallet connect to work.

# Privy App ID — for embedded wallet (email / Google login).
# Get yours at https://dashboard.privy.io → Apps → App ID
# When empty, the email/Google login option is hidden.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PRIVY_APP_ID=clm_abc123...

# Reown (AppKit) Project ID — for external wallets (MetaMask,
# Rabby, WalletConnect, etc.).
# Get yours at https://reown.com/dashboard → Projects → Project ID
# When empty, the external-wallet option is hidden.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_REOWN_PROJECT_ID=abc123...

# ── Robinhood Chain RPC ───────────────────────────────────────
# RH_RPC_URL is server-only (never sent to the browser). Use this
# to supply a keyed Alchemy / Dwellir / Tenderly endpoint.
# This is the primary RPC — lib/rpc.ts tries it first before the
# keyless public fallbacks.
# RH_RPC_URL=https://robinhood-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_ALCHEMY_KEY

# NEXT_PUBLIC_RH_RPC_URL is a legacy / browser-visible override.
# Only set this if you intentionally want to expose the RPC URL to
# the client (e.g. a keyless public endpoint). Do NOT put a keyed
# Alchemy URL here — use RH_RPC_URL above instead.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_RH_RPC_URL=https://rpc.mainnet.chain.robinhood.com

# ── Robinhood Chain WebSocket (WSS) ───────────────────────────
# Real-time streaming endpoint. The 3-tier hybrid system tries
# WebSocket first (sub-second latency), then silently falls back
# to the stable HTTP polling if WSS is blocked by AdBlocker/VPN/CORS.
#
# Verified working (2026-07-25):
#   Alchemy WSS endpoint — supports eth_subscribe (newHeads, logs)
#   Robinhood public RPC does NOT support WSS (only HTTP).
#
# When empty, the app skips WebSocket entirely and uses polling.
# Format: wss://... (use the Alchemy key from NEXT_PUBLIC_RH_RPC_URL,
# just swap https:// → wss://).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WSS_URL=wss://robinhood-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_ALCHEMY_KEY

# ── App URL ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used by Reown AppKit metadata and some external links.
# Default: https://robinhoodscreener.vercel.app
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ── Data Sources (optional) ───────────────────────────────────
# Most sources work without keys, but Birdeye and CoinMarketCap
# require an API key for enriched data.

# Birdeye API key — Free Standard plan.
# Get yours at https://birdeye.so/api
# When empty, Birdeye data is skipped.
# BIRDEYE_API_KEY=abc123...

# CoinMarketCap API key — Free Basic plan (333 calls/day).
# Get yours at https://pro.coinmarketcap.com
# When empty, CoinMarketCap data is skipped.
# COINMARKETCAP_API_KEY=abc123...

# Arkham Intelligence API key — real-time transaction tracking & entity attribution.
# Get yours at https://arkm.com/api
# When empty, falls back to Blockscout for transaction data.
# ARKHAM_API_KEY=abc123...
